<gnc-act:title>
  Business Accounts
</gnc-act:title>
<gnc-act:short-description>
  Full chart of accounts for a business.
</gnc-act:short-description>
<gnc-act:long-description>
  Users running a business want to select this instead of other choices. This includes all the accounts you need to run most businesses, including Payables, Receivables, Income, and Expenses. Add the Australian GST Accounts if the business is registered for GST.
</gnc-act:long-description>
<gnc-act:exclude-from-select-all>1</gnc-act:exclude-from-select-all>

